+  <div class="paragraph__column">
+      
+            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Yes! There are <a class="usa-link" href="/get-insured/buy-a-policy/homeowner-checklist" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="350ed3f2-a052-4859-986d-fe75f86a2ef4" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="How to prepare for a flood — and lower your premium">ways you can reduce your risk</a> — and cost as a result. For example, you may find savings if you elevate your water heater or electrical panel, so they are less likely to be damaged in a flood. Getting an elevation certificate, which documents your building's elevation, can also lower the price.</p></div>
+      
