+  <h2>Tax Estimator</h2>
+  
+
+
+<p class="MsoNormal">The Tax estimator is intended to assist current and potential property owners in estimating future taxes. To use this estimator, you’ll need the PIN number for the property you’d like to estimate. If you don’t know the pin, use our <a href="/apps/LandRecords/">Land Records</a> applications to locate a PIN by address or owner name.</p>
+<div><a href="https://www.horrycountysc.gov/departments/assessor/tax-estimator/" title="Tax Estimator" class="has-icon" data-anchor="#">Go To Tax Estimator</a></div>
