+<span style="font-weight: bold;"> SECTION 12-37-950.</span> Valuation of certain leasehold estates as real estate.<br /><br />
+	When any leasehold estate is conveyed for a definite term by any grantor whose property is exempt from taxation to a grantee whose property is not exempt, the leasehold estate shall be valued for property tax purposes as real estate.<br /><br />
