+	(7) a transfer of real property or other ownership interests among members of an affiliated group. As used in this item, &quot;affiliated group&quot; is as defined in Section 1504 of the Internal Revenue Code as defined in Section 12-6-40. Upon request of the applicable property tax assessor, a corporation shall furnish proof within forty-five days that a transfer meets the requirements of this item. A corporation that fails to comply with this request is subject to a civil penalty as provided in Section 12-37-3160(B);<br /><br />
